SUMMARY:Downtown Petaluma Walking Tours in August 2026
DESCRIPTION:Learn about Petaluma’s fascinating history\, filled with unique characters and surprising stories.\nPlease meet on the steps of the Petaluma Historical Library and Museum\n10:30 am to 12:00 pm\nFree\, Donations Appreciated.\nDowntown Petaluma Walking Tours in August\n(Please register for ticket)\nPlease Note:  There are no Saturday morning walks on August 1 and August 22. \n \nOur docents guide you through Petaluma’s downtown and surrounding neighborhoods. Meet us on the steps of the Petaluma Historical Museum. \nWant to schedule a private tour for friends and family? Sounds great\, please contact us at poyevents2026@gmail.com
URL:https://www.petalumamuseum.com/calendar-event/downtown-petaluma-walking-tours-in-august-2026/
LOCATION:Petaluma Historical Library & Museum\, 20 4th St\, Petaluma\, CA\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event,History Trails Walks,Petalumans of Yesteryear
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.petalumamuseum.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/POY-Walking-Tour-Flyers-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
